// Bundled SmogGuide, MissionCraft, dashboard, community and support pages.
module.exports = {"index.html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>SmogMission | Challenge 6</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#071728;color:#eef8ff;font:16px system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1080px;margin:auto;padding:65px 24px}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,5rem);margin:0 0 12px}p{line-height:1.7;color:#b8ccda}header{color:#85efda;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.13em}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(270px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:36px}.card{background:#102940;border:1px solid #31546c;border-radius:20px;padding:28px}.card h2{margin:8px 0}.card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;background:#72e5ce;color:#05252c;border-radius:11px;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750}.tag{color:#80d9e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}section{margin-top:48px;border-top:1px solid #31546c;padding-top:20px}footer{margin-top:45px;color:#9cb5c4;font-size:13px}</style></head><body><main><header>PROMPTWARS · CHALLENGE 6</header><h1>SmogMission</h1><p>Two interactive learning experiences, one sustainability mission. Make healthier low-emission choices for families on Earth, then explore the engineering trade-offs behind an Earth-observation satellite. The modules are educationally connected; their simulations are not real-world predictions.</p><form action=\"/logout\" method=\"post\" style=\"margin-top:18px\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"\"><button style=\"background:#17394b;border:1px solid #467b87;color:#c7f8ed;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer\">Sign out</button></form><div class=\"cards\"><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"tag\">01 · FAMILY AIR QUALITY</div><h2>SmogGuide</h2><p>Explore city pollution forecasts, personalized household advice, cleaner travel choices and an AI-generated winter-smog action plan. Gemini is optional; a labeled rules-based mode remains available.</p><a href=\"/smogguide\">Open SmogGuide →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"tag\">02 · SPACE SYSTEMS</div><h2>MissionCraft: Launch Lab</h2><p>Build a simulated Earth-observation satellite, balance mass, cost, energy and communications, pass the mission readiness gate, and learn from NASA POWER historical solar data.</p><a href=\"/missioncraft\">Open MissionCraft →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"tag\">03 · COMMUNITY</div><h2>Community chat</h2><p>Discuss air quality, space missions and project ideas with verified members. Channel-based conversations backed by PostgreSQL.</p><a href=\"/community\">Open Community →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"tag\">04 · HELP CENTER</div><h2>Support</h2><p>Create support tickets and follow their status. Optional Gmail SMTP notifications for administrators.</p><a href=\"/support\">Get support →</a></article></div><section><h2>How the two experiences connect</h2><p><strong>Observe → Understand → Act.</strong> SmogGuide illustrates why communities need environmental observations and practical low-emission decisions. MissionCraft demonstrates the constraints engineers face when designing an observation satellite. Its NASA POWER solar dataset is historical educational context—not live pollution monitoring or satellite telemetry. SmogGuide's Open-Meteo data are modeled forecasts, not readings from a MissionCraft satellite.</p><p>Try the SmogGuide air-quality plan, then build an Earth-observation satellite in MissionCraft. Compare the value of environmental information with the design trade-offs required to collect it.</p></section><footer>Built from the supplied SmogGuide and MissionCraft source projects. Educational demonstration. Health guidance is general information, not medical advice. Satellite parameters and budgets are illustrative.</footer></main></body></html>","smogguide.html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Family-focused air pollution planning using Open-Meteo forecasts and optional Gemini AI advice.\">\n<title>SmogGuide • Clean-air decisions for every family</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1724;--card:#14283a;--raised:#1a3449;--ink:#f3f8fc;--muted:#b8cad6;--line:#345068;--lime:#8ee2ae;--orange:#ffca8b;--red:#ffb5b0}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 0 0,#184766 0,transparent 45%),var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.55 system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif}a{color:var(--lime)}main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:24px 20px 60px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.brand{font-weight:850;font-size:1.35rem;letter-spacing:-.03em}.tag{font-size:.78rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:80px;padding:6px 12px;color:var(--lime)}h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,6vw,4.8rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.055em;max-width:830px;margin:68px 0 14px}h1 span{color:var(--lime)}.lead{max-width:670px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:34px}.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:19px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 14px 32px #0002}form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:17px}label{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);display:grid;gap:6px}input,select{font:inherit;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #557188;border-radius:9px;padding:12px;min-width:0;width:100%}input[type=checkbox]{width:auto;accent-color:var(--lime)}.checks{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;gap:10px 22px;flex-wrap:wrap}.checks label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.submit{grid-column:1/-1;padding:14px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--lime);color:#06251b;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem}.submit:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:progress}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px}.result{margin-top:27px}.dashboard{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:16px}.stat{font-size:4.1rem;font-weight:850;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.06em}.fine{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}.pill{display:inline-block;border-radius:50px;padding:5px 11px;background:#26475b;color:var(--lime);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700}.tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.tile{background:var(--raised);padding:12px;border-radius:11px}.tile strong{display:block;font-size:1.2rem}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}.wide{grid-column:1/-1}.item{padding:15px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.item:first-of-type{border-top:0}.item small{display:block;color:var(--lime);margin-top:4px}.item strong{font-weight:650}.item em{font-style:normal;color:var(--orange);font-size:.84rem}h2{font-size:1.22rem;margin:0 0 13px}.chart{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;height:140px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.bar{flex:1;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;background:#78d6bb;min-height:3px;position:relative}.bar:hover{background:#fff}.axis{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:.75rem;padding-top:7px}.notice{background:#2b3545;border-left:4px solid var(--orange);padding:12px;border-radius:5px}.error{background:#532c37;color:#ffe2e2;border:1px solid #a56b77;padding:13px;border-radius:10px}footer{font-size:.83rem;color:var(--muted);padding-top:22px}footer p{margin:7px 0}.sources{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}@media(max-width:700px){form,.dashboard,.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wide{grid-column:auto}.tiles{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.panel{padding:18px}h1{margin-top:42px}.stat{font-size:3.4rem}}\n</style></head><body><main><header class=\"top\"><div class=\"brand\">🌿 SmogGuide <span class=\"tag\">Challenge 6 • PromptWars</span></div><span class=\"tag\">Family-first clean-air planning</span></header>\n<h1>Smarter days.<br><span>Cleaner choices.</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">Understand your city’s pollution forecast, adapt your family's routine, and explore lower-emission decisions. Powered by Open-Meteo data, with optional Gemini guidance.</p>\n<section class=\"panel\"><h2>Your family’s clean-air plan</h2><form id=\"form\"><label>City<input name=\"city\" value=\"Delhi\" placeholder=\"Delhi, Chennai, Bengaluru…\" required maxlength=\"75\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\"></label><label>Advice language<select name=\"lang\"><option>English</option><option>Tamil</option><option>Hindi</option></select></label><label>Daily commute<select name=\"commute\"><option>Car</option><option>Two-wheeler</option><option>Bus or metro</option><option>Walk or cycle</option><option>Work from home</option></select></label><label>Cooking / heating fuel<select name=\"fuel\"><option>LPG</option><option>Electric</option><option>Firewood or biomass</option><option>Coal</option></select></label><div class=\"checks\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"children\">Children</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"elders\">Older adults</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"asthma\">Respiratory sensitivity</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"purifier\">Air purifier available</label></div><button class=\"submit\" id=\"submit\">Generate my plan</button></form></section>\n<div id=\"output\" class=\"result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><footer><p>Sources: <a href=\"https://open-meteo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open-Meteo</a> (modeled air-quality/weather data); <a href=\"https://www.meteomatics.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Meteomatics</a> (optional licensed weather access); <a href=\"https://ai.google.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Gemini</a> (optional advice).</p><p>US AQI shown using Open-Meteo estimates, not India's CPCB AQI. This tool provides general environmental guidance, not a medical diagnosis or government alert. Check official local AQI and health advisories.</p><p>Independent PromptWars Challenge 6 project. MissionCraft is a separate NASA Space Apps submission.</p></footer></main>\n<script>\nconst $=s=>document.querySelector(s);const escapeHTML=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;',\"'\":'&#39;'}[c]));\nconst value=(v,digits=1)=>typeof v==='number'&&Number.isFinite(v)?v.toFixed(digits):'N/A';\nfunction showList(items,titleKey){return (Array.isArray(items)?items:[]).map(x=>`<div class=\"item\"><strong>${escapeHTML(x[titleKey])}</strong> ${x.time?`<em>${escapeHTML(x.time)}</em>`:''}<small>Why it helps: ${escapeHTML(x.impact)}</small></div>`).join('')}\nfunction chart(hours){const vals=hours.filter(h=>typeof h.pm2_5==='number'&&h.pm2_5>=0).slice(0,24);if(!vals.length)return '<p class=\"fine\">Hourly chart unavailable</p>';const max=Math.max(1,...vals.map(h=>h.pm2_5));return `<div class=\"chart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hourly modeled particulate matter PM2.5 for the first 24 forecast hours\">${vals.map(h=>`<div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:${Math.max(2,Math.min(100,h.pm2_5/max*100))}%\" title=\"${escapeHTML(h.time)}: ${value(h.pm2_5)} micrograms per cubic meter\"></div>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"axis\"><span>${escapeHTML(vals[0].time.slice(11,16))}</span><span>${escapeHTML(vals[Math.floor(vals.length/2)].time.slice(11,16))}</span><span>${escapeHTML(vals[vals.length-1].time.slice(11,16))}</span></div>`}\nfunction render(j){const a=j.advice||{},cur=j.current||{};const state=j.source==='gemini'?'Gemini AI guidance':'Rule-based advice (AI unavailable)';const note=j.meteomatics_status==='active'?'Meteomatics active':'Open-Meteo weather';return `<div class=\"dashboard\"><section class=\"panel\"><span class=\"pill\">${escapeHTML(a.risk_level)}</span><div class=\"stat\">${value(cur.us_aqi,0)}</div><strong>US Air Quality Index</strong><p class=\"fine\">${escapeHTML(j.place)} · ${escapeHTML(j.measurement_time||'Time not available')} (${escapeHTML(j.timezone)})</p><div class=\"tiles\"><div class=\"tile\"><strong>${value(cur.pm2_5)}</strong><span class=\"fine\">PM2.5 µg/m³</span></div><div class=\"tile\"><strong>${value(cur.pm10)}</strong><span class=\"fine\">PM10 µg/m³</span></div><div class=\"tile\"><strong>${value(cur.nitrogen_dioxide)}</strong><span class=\"fine\">NO₂ µg/m³</span></div></div></section><section class=\"panel\"><span class=\"pill\">${escapeHTML(state)}</span><p>${escapeHTML(a.summary)}</p><p class=\"sources\">Weather: ${escapeHTML(j.weather_source)} · ${escapeHTML(note)}</p>${a.language_note?`<p class=\"notice\">${escapeHTML(a.language_note)}</p>`:''}${j.meteomatics_status==='unavailable'?'<p class=\"notice\">Meteomatics connection failed; Open-Meteo data remains available.</p>':''}</section></div><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"panel wide\"><h2>Hourly PM2.5 forecast</h2>${chart(j.hourly||[])}<p class=\"fine\">Model estimate (µg/m³), not continuous on-site sensor readings. Check local alerts before planning outdoor time.</p></section><section class=\"panel\"><h2>🗓 Daily routine</h2>${showList(a.routine,'action')}</section><section class=\"panel\"><h2>🏠 Improve indoor air</h2>${showList(a.indoor_hacks,'tip')}</section><section class=\"panel\"><h2>🌱 Lower-emission alternatives</h2>${showList(a.alternatives,'tip')}</section><section class=\"panel\"><h2>🛡 Protect your family</h2><p>${escapeHTML(a.protect_vulnerable)}</p><p class=\"fine\">Advice can be imperfect and is not medical care.</p></section></div>`}\n$('#form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();let btn=$('#submit'),out=$('#output');const d=new FormData(e.target);btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Loading environmental data…';out.innerHTML='<div class=\"panel\">Checking air quality and generating guidance…</div>';const profile={commute:d.get('commute'),fuel:d.get('fuel'),children:d.has('children'),older_adults:d.has('elders'),asthma:d.has('asthma'),has_purifier:d.has('purifier')};try{const r=await fetch('/api/advice',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({city:d.get('city'),lang:d.get('lang'),profile})});const j=await r.json();out.innerHTML=r.ok?render(j):`<p class=\"error\" role=\"alert\">${escapeHTML(j.error||'Request failed.')}</p>`}catch(_){out.innerHTML='<p class=\"error\" role=\"alert\">Unable to connect to the app server. Please try again.</p>'}finally{btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Generate my plan'}});\n</script><a href=\"/\" style=\"position:fixed;bottom:12px;right:12px;background:#12394b;color:white;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:20px;z-index:10;text-decoration:none\">← SmogMission hub</a></body></html>\n","community.html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>SmogMission | Community</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#091827;color:#eaf7ff;font:16px system-ui}header{padding:18px 24px;background:#112a3e;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}a{color:#7fe6d5}main{max-width:1120px;margin:25px auto;padding:0 16px}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:210px 1fr;gap:18px}.panel{background:#10283b;border:1px solid #34566a;border-radius:18px;padding:18px}nav button{display:block;width:100%;margin:6px 0;padding:12px;text-align:left}button{border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#74dfca;color:#08252a;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;padding:12px}nav button.active{background:#a7f5e7}#messages{height:53vh;overflow:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.msg{background:#1c3b4e;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#b3cbd5;margin-bottom:5px}.compose{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}input{background:#071b2b;border:1px solid #527082;border-radius:10px;color:white;padding:12px;min-width:0;flex:1}#status{color:#b9d5db}@media(max-width:650px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{display:flex;overflow:auto;gap:6px}nav button{min-width:120px}#messages{height:48vh}}</style></head><body><header><strong>SmogMission · Community</strong><a href=\"/\">← Dashboard</a></header><main><p>Welcome, {{ user_email | e }}. Public channels are visible to signed-in members. Never share private information.</p><div class=\"layout\"><nav class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Channels\"><button data-channel=\"general\" class=\"active\"># general</button><button data-channel=\"air-quality\"># air-quality</button><button data-channel=\"space-missions\"># space-missions</button><button data-channel=\"help\"># help</button></nav><section class=\"panel\"><h2 id=\"heading\"># general</h2><div id=\"messages\" role=\"log\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><form class=\"compose\" id=\"compose\"><input id=\"body\" maxlength=\"1000\" required placeholder=\"Message the community\" aria-label=\"Message\"><button>Send</button></form><p id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p></section></div></main><script>let channel='general';const box=document.getElementById('messages'),status=document.getElementById('status');async function load(){try{const r=await fetch('/api/community/messages?channel='+encodeURIComponent(channel));const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Could not load');box.replaceChildren();for(const m of d.messages){const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='msg';const meta=document.createElement('div');meta.className='meta';meta.textContent=m.display_name+' · '+new Date(m.created_at).toLocaleString();const content=document.createElement('div');content.textContent=m.body;el.append(meta,content);box.append(el)}box.scrollTop=box.scrollHeight;status.textContent=''}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message}}document.querySelectorAll('[data-channel]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{channel=b.dataset.channel;document.getElementById('heading').textContent='# '+channel;document.querySelectorAll('[data-channel]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x===b));load()});document.getElementById('compose').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const input=document.getElementById('body');try{const r=await fetch('/api/community/messages',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({channel,body:input.value,display_name:'Member'})});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Failed');input.value='';await load()}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message}};load();setInterval(()=>{if(!document.hidden)load()},8000);</script></body></html>","support.html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>SmogMission | Support</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#081a2a;color:#effbff;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:760px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px}a{color:#81e5d2}.card{padding:24px;border:1px solid #3c6074;background:#112d42;border-radius:18px;margin:20px 0}input,textarea{width:100%;margin:8px 0 16px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #668699;background:#061c2b;color:white;font:inherit}button{background:#75e5ce;color:#05232c;border:0;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}li{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #416276}small{color:#b6cbd6}</style></head><body><main><a href=\"/\">← Dashboard</a><h1>Support center</h1><p>Signed in as {{ user_email | e }}. Open a ticket for help with SmogGuide, MissionCraft or your account.</p><div class=\"card\"><h2>New support ticket</h2><form id=\"ticket\"><label>Subject<input id=\"subject\" required minlength=\"5\" maxlength=\"120\"></label><label>Describe your issue<textarea id=\"details\" required minlength=\"10\" maxlength=\"3000\" rows=\"5\"></textarea></label><button>Submit ticket</button></form><p id=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p></div><div class=\"card\"><h2>Your tickets</h2><ul id=\"tickets\"></ul></div><small>Gmail notifications are optional and require SMTP configuration by the project administrator. Phone number and SMS support are not enabled.</small></main><script>const status=document.getElementById('status');async function load(){try{const r=await fetch('/api/support/tickets');const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Unavailable');const ul=document.getElementById('tickets');ul.replaceChildren();for(const t of d.tickets){const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=t.subject+' — '+t.status+' · '+new Date(t.created_at).toLocaleDateString();ul.append(li)}}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message}}document.getElementById('ticket').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();try{const r=await fetch('/api/support/tickets',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({subject:document.getElementById('subject').value,details:document.getElementById('details').value})});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(d.error||'Failed');status.textContent='Ticket submitted successfully';e.target.reset();load()}catch(e){status.textContent=e.message}};load();</script></body></html>","missioncraft/index.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MissionCraft: Launch Lab</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#07111f;--panel:#0e1c2e;--panel2:#13253a;--line:#243b55;--text:#edf5ff;--muted:#91a7c0;--cyan:#57d7ee;--blue:#4b8dff;--green:#4fe0a0;--amber:#ffca67;--red:#ff727e;--shadow:0 16px 40px #0005}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% -10%,#173b66 0,transparent 38%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 0% 65%,#0d2c43 0,transparent 35%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:15px/1.5 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;min-height:100vh}\nbutton{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.app{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:24px}.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:22px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#6ce7f4,#367cff);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#061425;font-size:23px;box-shadow:0 0 24px #57d7ee55}.brand h1{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:0}.brand p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.top-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}.pill{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#112238;color:#c9d9eb;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px}.btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#172b43;color:var(--text);padding:10px 15px;border-radius:11px;font-weight:650;transition:.2s}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:#4b779e}.btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#4b8dff,#37c9db);color:#041321;border:0}.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:250px minmax(0,1fr) 285px;gap:18px;align-items:start}.panel{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#11243aee,#0b1929f2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.sidebar{padding:18px;position:sticky;top:18px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.side-title{margin:7px 0 18px;font-size:18px}.step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:11px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:5px 0;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent}.step .num{height:27px;width:27px;border-radius:9px;background:#1a3049;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.step.active{background:#15324a;color:var(--text);border-color:#2b6681}.step.active .num{background:var(--cyan);color:#061522}.step.done .num{background:#174c43;color:var(--green)}.sidebar-note{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:20px;padding-top:15px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.main{min-width:0}.hero{padding:24px;min-height:192px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#122c48,#102238 55%,#102f4a)}.hero:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:330px;height:330px;border-radius:50%;right:3%;top:-90px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%,#9df6ff 0,#2c94c6 17%,#17649b 38%,#0d3153 62%,#071628 70%);box-shadow:0 0 45px #3ccaf055}.hero:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:470px;height:120px;border:1px solid #66ddf455;border-radius:50%;right:-1%;top:20px;transform:rotate(-18deg);z-index:1}.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:62%}.hero h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);line-height:1.12;margin:10px 0}.hero p{color:#b5cbe0;max-width:560px;margin:0 0 18px}.tagline{color:var(--cyan);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.content{padding:22px;margin-top:18px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:15px;margin-bottom:18px}.section-head h3{font-size:20px;margin:0}.section-head p{color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px}.status{font-size:11px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:#183a3a;color:var(--green);white-space:nowrap}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.component{padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#0c1b2c;position:relative;transition:.2s}.component.selected{border-color:var(--cyan);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #57d7ee55;background:#102a3b}.component h4{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:15px}.component p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px;min-height:36px}.metrics{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.metric{font-size:10px;color:#c2d5e8;background:#172b41;border-radius:7px;padding:4px 7px}.component button{margin-top:12px;width:100%;padding:8px;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid #35526f;background:#142940;color:#dcecff;font-weight:700;font-size:12px}.component.selected button{background:#153e4b;border-color:#3bb7c8;color:#8eeafa}.checklist{display:grid;gap:10px}.check{padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;background:#0b1a2b}.check-icon{width:23px;height:23px;flex:none;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#183b34;color:var(--green);font-weight:900}.check.fail .check-icon{background:#47272e;color:var(--red)}.check strong{display:block;font-size:13px}.check small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;margin-top:2px}.resource{padding:18px;position:sticky;top:18px}.resource h3{margin:3px 0 15px;font-size:16px}.res{margin:14px 0}.res-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px}.res-top span:last-child{color:#c2d6e9;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.bar{height:7px;border-radius:99px;background:#1b3048;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4c8fff,#57d7ee);width:0%;transition:width .25s}.bar.warning i{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f5ab56,#ff727e)}.resource-foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;margin-top:15px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.launch-art{height:230px;border-radius:15px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 100%,#244f79 0,#122a45 45%,#081523 80%);position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:17px}.stars{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#c9edff 1px,transparent 1px),radial-gradient(#8ccbf4 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:59px 59px,97px 97px;background-position:0 0,25px 35px;opacity:.38}.rocket{position:relative;font-size:74px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 15px #7bdfff88);z-index:1;transition:transform 2s ease}.launch-art.launched .rocket{transform:translateY(-180px) rotate(5deg)}.launch-caption{position:absolute;bottom:12px;z-index:2;color:#a9c6df;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.progress{height:8px;background:#20364e;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;margin:14px 0}.progress i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4b8dff,#57d7ee);transition:width .6s}.report-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:15px 0}.report-stat{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#0a1929}.report-stat b{display:block;font-size:24px}.report-stat span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em}.hidden{display:none!important}.footer{padding:18px 3px;color:#7088a2;font-size:11px;text-align:center}.toast{position:fixed;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,20px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;background:#dffaff;color:#082032;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:.25s;z-index:9}.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}.top-actions a{text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.nasa-mini{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.nasa-mini button{width:100%;margin-top:9px}.nasa-mini strong{color:#d9efff}.nasa-result{margin-top:7px;line-height:1.45;min-height:30px}\n@media(max-width:1050px){.layout{grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr)}.resource{grid-column:2;position:static;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:0 18px}.resource h3,.resource .eyebrow,.resource-foot{grid-column:1/-1}}\n@media(max-width:700px){.app{padding:13px}.topbar{align-items:flex-start}.top-actions .pill{display:none}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{position:static}.sidebar nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.sidebar-note{display:none}.resource{grid-column:auto;position:static}.hero-content{max-width:100%}.hero:after{opacity:.22;right:-120px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.report-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{min-height:210px}.content{padding:16px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"app\">\n<header class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"logo\">✦</div><div><h1>MISSIONCRAFT <span style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">/</span> LAUNCH LAB</h1><p>SPACE MISSION DESIGN SIMULATOR · PRE-LEVEL 0</p></div></div><div class=\"top-actions\"><span class=\"pill\" id=\"syncStatus\">● LOCAL SAVE</span><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/missioncraft/demo\">7-slide demo ↗</a><button class=\"btn\" id=\"cloudSaveBtn\">Save mission</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"resetBtn\">↺ Reset</button></div><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#8de7f6;padding:10px 20px;display:inline-block\">← SmogMission hub</a></header>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n<aside class=\"panel sidebar\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Mission pathway</div><h2 class=\"side-title\">Mission Control</h2><nav id=\"steps\">\n<div class=\"step active\" data-step=\"0\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><span>Mission briefing</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"1\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><span>Spacecraft builder</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"2\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><span>Launch readiness</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"3\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><span>Launch sequence</span></div>\n<div class=\"step\" data-step=\"4\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><span>Mission report</span></div>\n</nav><div class=\"sidebar-note\"><b style=\"color:#d7e8f8\">Training objective</b><br>Build a satellite that can observe Earth while staying inside the mission's resource limits.</div></aside>\n<main class=\"main\">\n<section class=\"panel hero\"><div class=\"hero-content\"><div class=\"tagline\">Your first mission starts here</div><h2>Design a mission.<br><span style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">Make it launch-ready.</span></h2><p>Take command of a small Earth-observation mission. Choose your spacecraft systems, balance your resources and see whether your design can reach orbit.</p><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"heroStart\">Begin mission <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></button></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel content\" id=\"view0\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">01 · Mission briefing</div><h3>Earth Observer-01</h3><p>A low-cost satellite designed to capture images of Earth's land and coastal regions.</p></div><span class=\"status\">TRAINING MISSION</span></div><div class=\"cards\"><article class=\"component selected\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Mission objective</div><h4>Earth observation</h4><p>Collect simulated surface imagery for environmental monitoring and educational analysis.</p><div class=\"metrics\"><span class=\"metric\">LEO target orbit</span><span class=\"metric\">Remote sensing</span></div></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Mission constraints</div><h4>Limited resources</h4><p>Your design must stay within the training budget, mass and power envelope.</p><div class=\"metrics\"><span class=\"metric\">100 credits</span><span class=\"metric\">500 kg max</span><span class=\"metric\">Power balance</span></div></article></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn primary\" data-go=\"1\">Build spacecraft →</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel content hidden\" id=\"view1\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">02 · Spacecraft builder</div><h3>Configure your satellite</h3><p>Choose one component in each system category. Your resources update as you make decisions.</p></div><span class=\"status\">5 SYSTEMS</span></div><div id=\"componentGroups\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:20px\"><button class=\"btn\" data-go=\"0\">← Briefing</button><button class=\"btn primary\" data-go=\"2\">Check readiness →</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel content hidden\" id=\"view2\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">03 · Launch readiness</div><h3>Engineering checks</h3><p>Review the current design before selecting a launch vehicle.</p></div><span class=\"status\" id=\"readinessBadge\">ANALYSIS</span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><b style=\"font-size:14px\">Choose a launch vehicle</b><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:3px 0 10px\">The vehicle must carry your satellite within its training payload capacity.</div><div class=\"cards\" id=\"launcherChoices\"></div></div><div class=\"checklist\" id=\"checks\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:20px\"><button class=\"btn\" data-go=\"1\">← Edit design</button><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"toLaunch\">Continue to launch →</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel content hidden\" id=\"view3\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">04 · Launch sequence</div><h3>Flight operations</h3><p>Complete the simulated countdown and deploy your Earth-observation satellite.</p></div><span class=\"status\">SIMULATION</span></div><div class=\"launch-art\" id=\"launchArt\"><div class=\"stars\"></div><div class=\"rocket\">🚀</div><div class=\"launch-caption\" id=\"launchCaption\">Vehicle on launch pad · Awaiting authorization</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\"><span id=\"launchStatus\">T − 00:10 · SYSTEMS STANDBY</span><b id=\"launchPct\">0%</b></div><div class=\"progress\"><i id=\"launchProgress\"></i></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"launchBtn\">Initiate countdown</button></div></section>\n<section class=\"panel content hidden\" id=\"view4\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">05 · Mission report</div><h3 id=\"reportTitle\">Mission evaluation</h3><p id=\"reportText\">Your mission results are ready.</p></div><span class=\"status\" id=\"reportBadge\">COMPLETE</span></div><div class=\"report-grid\"><div class=\"report-stat\"><b id=\"score\">—</b><span>Mission score</span></div><div class=\"report-stat\"><b id=\"reportBudget\">—</b><span>Credits used</span></div><div class=\"report-stat\"><b id=\"reportMass\">—</b><span>Satellite mass</span></div></div><div class=\"checklist\" id=\"reportDetails\"></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:20px\"><button class=\"btn\" data-go=\"1\">Rebuild spacecraft</button><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"newMission\">Start new mission ↻</button></div></section>\n<div class=\"footer\">MissionCraft: Launch Lab · Educational prototype · All resource values are illustrative game parameters, not real spacecraft specifications.</div>\n</main>\n<aside class=\"panel resource\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Live telemetry</div><h3>Mission resources</h3>\n<div class=\"res\"><div class=\"res-top\"><b>Budget</b><span id=\"budgetText\">0 / 100 cr</span></div><div class=\"bar\" id=\"budgetBar\"><i></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"res\"><div class=\"res-top\"><b>Spacecraft mass</b><span id=\"massText\">0 / 500 kg</span></div><div class=\"bar\" id=\"massBar\"><i></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"res\"><div class=\"res-top\"><b>Power balance</b><span id=\"powerText\">0 / 0 W</span></div><div class=\"bar\" id=\"powerBar\"><i></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"res\"><div class=\"res-top\"><b>Communication</b><span id=\"commText\">0 / 30 units</span></div><div class=\"bar\" id=\"commBar\"><i></i></div></div>\n<div class=\"resource-foot\">Resource values recalculate automatically when you change a component. Choose systems that work together.</div>\n<div class=\"nasa-mini\"><strong>NASA POWER · Solar context</strong><div>Retrieve historical daily solar radiation near Chennai. This is environmental reference data, not real-time spacecraft power telemetry.</div><button class=\"btn\" id=\"loadNasa\">Load NASA data</button><div class=\"nasa-result\" id=\"nasaResult\">Not loaded yet.</div><a href=\"https://power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/services/api/temporal/daily/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">NASA POWER data documentation ↗</a></div>\n</aside>\n</div></div><div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></div>\n<script>\nconst LIMITS={budget:100,mass:500,powerNeed:0,commNeed:30};\nconst catalog=[\n{key:'bus',name:'Spacecraft bus',hint:'The main structure that houses and supports the satellite systems.',items:[\n{id:'compact',name:'Compact Explorer Bus',desc:'A lightweight platform for a small educational mission.',cost:18,mass:120,power:0,draw:12,comm:0},\n{id:'standard',name:'Standard Research Bus',desc:'A balanced platform with room for additional instruments.',cost:28,mass:190,power:0,draw:18,comm:0},\n{id:'heavy',name:'Heavy-Duty Bus',desc:'A robust but heavier platform with greater system overhead.',cost:36,mass:270,power:0,draw:28,comm:0}]},\n{key:'payload',name:'Scientific payload',hint:'The instrument that performs the mission observation.',items:[\n{id:'camera',name:'Multispectral Camera',desc:'Captures simulated land-cover and coastal imagery.',cost:22,mass:65,power:24,draw:0,comm:8},\n{id:'imager',name:'Wide-Area Imager',desc:'Covers a wider scene with a larger resource footprint.',cost:30,mass:105,power:34,draw:0,comm:14},\n{id:'sensor',name:'Basic Optical Sensor',desc:'A simple low-resource instrument for training missions.',cost:12,mass:35,power:12,draw:0,comm:4}]},\n{key:'power',name:'Power system',hint:'Generates electricity for the spacecraft and instruments.',items:[\n{id:'solar-small',name:'Compact Solar Array',desc:'A small array for low-power satellite configurations.',cost:14,mass:35,power:0,draw:0,generation:35,comm:0},\n{id:'solar-large',name:'Deployable Solar Array',desc:'Higher generation capacity with additional mass and cost.',cost:23,mass:65,power:0,draw:0,generation:65,comm:0},\n{id:'battery',name:'Battery Training Pack',desc:'A limited training-only power source; low mass but low output.',cost:9,mass:22,power:0,draw:0,generation:18,comm:0}]},\n{key:'comms',name:'Communication system',hint:'Sends collected mission data to a ground station.',items:[\n{id:'uhf',name:'UHF Basic Link',desc:'A simple low-capacity link for basic telemetry.',cost:9,mass:18,power:0,draw:5,comm:20},\n{id:'sband',name:'S-Band Data Link',desc:'A higher-capacity link for observation data.',cost:16,mass:28,power:0,draw:8,comm:45},\n{id:'xband',name:'X-Band High-Rate Link',desc:'High data capacity with a larger resource requirement.',cost:22,mass:38,power:0,draw:13,comm:70}]},\n{key:'thermal',name:'Thermal control',hint:'Helps keep spacecraft equipment within its operating temperature range.',items:[\n{id:'passive',name:'Passive Thermal Kit',desc:'Lightweight thermal blankets and surface coatings.',cost:8,mass:16,power:0,draw:2,comm:0},\n{id:'active',name:'Active Thermal Kit',desc:'Adds powered thermal management for sensitive equipment.',cost:15,mass:32,power:0,draw:10,comm:0},\n{id:'basic',name:'Basic Insulation',desc:'Minimal thermal protection for the training scenario.',cost:4,mass:10,power:0,draw:1,comm:0}]}\n];\nconst launchers=[{id:'small',name:'Small Launch Vehicle',capacity:300,cost:0},{id:'medium',name:'Medium Launch Vehicle',capacity:500,cost:5},{id:'heavy',name:'Heavy Launch Vehicle',capacity:800,cost:12}];\nlet selected={bus:'compact',payload:'camera',power:'solar-large',comms:'sband',thermal:'passive'},selectedLauncher='medium',step=0,launched=false;\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const chosen=key=>catalog.find(g=>g.key===key).items.find(x=>x.id===selected[key]);\nfunction totals(){let t={cost:0,mass:0,generation:0,draw:0,comm:0};catalog.forEach(g=>{let x=chosen(g.key);if(x){t.cost+=x.cost;t.mass+=x.mass;t.generation+=x.generation||0;t.draw+=x.draw||0;t.comm+=x.comm||0;}});let lv=launchers.find(x=>x.id===selectedLauncher);if(lv)t.cost+=lv.cost;return t}\nfunction renderLaunchers(){let root=$('launcherChoices');root.innerHTML=launchers.map(x=>`<article class=\"component ${selectedLauncher===x.id?'selected':''}\"><h4>${x.name}</h4><p>Training payload capacity: ${x.capacity} kg.</p><div class=\"metrics\"><span class=\"metric\">${x.cost} cr selection cost</span><span class=\"metric\">${x.capacity} kg capacity</span></div><button data-launcher=\"${x.id}\">${selectedLauncher===x.id?'✓ Selected':'Select vehicle'}</button></article>`).join('');root.querySelectorAll('[data-launcher]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{selectedLauncher=b.dataset.launcher;renderLaunchers();updateResources();renderChecks();save();}));}\nfunction renderGroups(){let root=$('componentGroups');root.innerHTML='';catalog.forEach(g=>{let group=document.createElement('div');group.style.marginBottom='21px';group.innerHTML=`<div style=\"margin-bottom:10px\"><b style=\"font-size:14px\">${g.name}</b><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">${g.hint}</div></div><div class=\"cards\">${g.items.map(x=>`<article class=\"component ${selected[g.key]===x.id?'selected':''}\"><h4>${x.name}</h4><p>${x.desc}</p><div class=\"metrics\"><span class=\"metric\">${x.cost} cr</span><span class=\"metric\">${x.mass} kg</span>${x.generation?`<span class=\"metric\">+${x.generation} W</span>`:''}${x.draw?`<span class=\"metric\">${x.draw} W draw</span>`:''}${x.comm?`<span class=\"metric\">${x.comm} data</span>`:''}</div><button data-pick=\"${g.key}\" data-id=\"${x.id}\">${selected[g.key]===x.id?'✓ Selected':'Select component'}</button></article>`).join('')}</div>`;root.appendChild(group)});root.querySelectorAll('[data-pick]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{selected[b.dataset.pick]=b.dataset.id;renderGroups();updateResources();save();}));}\nfunction updateResources(){let t=totals(),lv=launchers.find(x=>x.id===selectedLauncher);setResource('budget',t.cost,LIMITS.budget,' cr');setResource('mass',t.mass,lv.capacity,' kg');setResource('power',t.generation,t.draw,' W');setResource('comm',t.comm,LIMITS.commNeed,' units');}\nfunction setResource(key,value,max,unit){$(key+'Text').textContent=key==='power'?`${value} / ${max}${unit}`:`${value} / ${max}${unit}`;let pct=key==='power'?(max===0?100:Math.min(100,value/max*100)):Math.min(100,value/max*100);let bar=$(key+'Bar');bar.querySelector('i').style.width=pct+'%';bar.classList.toggle('warning',key==='budget'?value>max:key==='mass'?value>max:key==='power'?value<max:key==='comm'?value<max:false);}\nfunction checks(){let t=totals();return [\n{ok:t.cost<=LIMITS.budget,title:'Mission budget',detail:`${t.cost} of ${LIMITS.budget} credits used.`},\n{ok:t.mass<=launchers.find(x=>x.id===selectedLauncher).capacity,title:'Launch vehicle capacity',detail:`${t.mass} kg satellite mass · ${launchers.find(x=>x.id===selectedLauncher).capacity} kg selected vehicle capacity.`},\n{ok:t.generation>=t.draw,title:'Power balance',detail:`Generation ${t.generation} W · estimated draw ${t.draw} W.`},\n{ok:t.comm>=LIMITS.commNeed,title:'Data communication',detail:`${t.comm} capacity units · ${LIMITS.commNeed} required for this training mission.`},\n{ok:!!selected.bus&&!!selected.payload&&!!selected.power&&!!selected.comms&&!!selected.thermal,title:'System configuration',detail:'All five spacecraft system categories have a selected component.'}\n]}\nfunction renderChecks(){renderLaunchers();let c=checks(),passed=c.filter(x=>x.ok).length;$('checks').innerHTML=c.map(x=>`<div class=\"check ${x.ok?'':'fail'}\"><div class=\"check-icon\">${x.ok?'✓':'!'}</div><div><strong>${x.title}</strong><small>${x.detail}</small></div></div>`).join('');$('readinessBadge').textContent=`${passed}/${c.length} CHECKS PASSED`;$('readinessBadge').style.background=passed===c.length?'#183a3a':'#472d26';$('readinessBadge').style.color=passed===c.length?'var(--green)':'var(--amber)';$('toLaunch').disabled=passed!==c.length;}\nfunction go(n){step=n;document.querySelectorAll('[id^=\"view\"]').forEach(v=>v.classList.add('hidden'));$('view'+n).classList.remove('hidden');document.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach(s=>{let x=+s.dataset.step;s.classList.toggle('active',x===n);s.classList.toggle('done',x<n)});if(n===2)renderChecks();if(n===1)renderGroups();if(n===4)renderReport();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});}\nfunction toast(s){$('toast').textContent=s;$('toast').classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>$('toast').classList.remove('show'),1900)}\nconst SESSION_KEY='missioncraft-session-id';\nfunction sessionId(){let id=localStorage.getItem(SESSION_KEY);if(!id){id=(crypto.randomUUID?crypto.randomUUID():('mc-'+Date.now()+'-'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)));localStorage.setItem(SESSION_KEY,id)}return id}\nlet cloudTimer=null;\nfunction setSyncStatus(message,ok=false){const el=$('syncStatus');if(el){el.textContent=(ok?'● ':'○ ')+message;el.style.color=ok?'var(--green)':'var(--amber)'}}\nfunction currentMission(){return {components:{...selected},launchVehicle:selectedLauncher,mission:'Earth Observer-01',version:1,updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()}}\nasync function cloudSave(){try{setSyncStatus('SYNCING…');const response=await fetch('/api/mission',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({sessionId:sessionId(),payload:currentMission()})});if(!response.ok){const data=await response.json().catch(()=>({}));throw new Error(data.error||'Cloud storage not configured')}setSyncStatus('CLOUD SAVED',true);toast('Mission saved to cloud')}catch(e){setSyncStatus('LOCAL SAVE · CLOUD NOT SET');console.info('Cloud save unavailable; local save remains active:',e.message)}}\nfunction save(){const state={...selected,_launcher:selectedLauncher};try{localStorage.setItem('missioncraft-save',JSON.stringify(state))}catch(e){}setSyncStatus('LOCAL SAVE',true);clearTimeout(cloudTimer);cloudTimer=setTimeout(cloudSave,900)}\nasync function restoreCloud(){try{const response=await fetch('/api/mission?sessionId='+encodeURIComponent(sessionId()));if(!response.ok)return;const result=await response.json();if(!result.payload)return;const data=result.payload;catalog.forEach(g=>{if(data.components&&g.items.some(i=>i.id===data.components[g.key]))selected[g.key]=data.components[g.key]});if(data.launchVehicle&&launchers.some(x=>x.id===data.launchVehicle))selectedLauncher=data.launchVehicle;localStorage.setItem('missioncraft-save',JSON.stringify({...selected,_launcher:selectedLauncher}));renderGroups();renderLaunchers();updateResources();setSyncStatus('CLOUD RESTORED',true)}catch(e){console.info('Cloud restore unavailable:',e.message)}}\nfunction load(){try{let d=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('missioncraft-save'));if(d){catalog.forEach(g=>{if(g.items.some(i=>i.id===d[g.key]))selected[g.key]=d[g.key]});if(launchers.some(x=>x.id===d._launcher))selectedLauncher=d._launcher}}catch(e){}}\nfunction runLaunch(){let btn=$('launchBtn'),status=$('launchStatus'),pct=$('launchPct'),bar=$('launchProgress'),caption=$('launchCaption'),art=$('launchArt');btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Sequence in progress…';let phases=[['T − 00:10 · FLIGHT COMPUTERS ONLINE','Flight computers online',18],['T − 00:06 · PROPULSION CHECK','Propulsion checks nominal',38],['T − 00:03 · FINAL GO','All stations report go',62],['T + 00:00 · LIFTOFF','Liftoff · ascending through atmosphere',82],['T + 00:20 · ORBIT INSERTION','Satellite deployed into training orbit',100]];let i=0;function tick(){let p=phases[i];status.textContent=p[0];caption.textContent=p[1];pct.textContent=p[2]+'%';bar.style.width=p[2]+'%';if(i===3)art.classList.add('launched');i++;if(i<phases.length)setTimeout(tick,1050);else{launched=true;btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='View mission report';btn.onclick=()=>go(4);toast('Satellite deployment sequence complete');}}tick()}\nfunction renderReport(){let t=totals(),c=checks(),passed=c.filter(x=>x.ok).length,score=Math.round(passed/c.length*100);$('score').textContent=score+'/100';$('reportBudget').textContent=t.cost+' cr';$('reportMass').textContent=t.mass+' kg';$('reportTitle').textContent=launched?'Earth Observer-01 deployed':'Mission design report';$('reportText').textContent=launched?'The training launch sequence completed and the satellite was deployed in simulated orbit.':'Your current configuration has been evaluated. Resolve failed checks and launch again.';$('reportBadge').textContent=launched?'DEPLOYED':'DESIGN REVIEW';$('reportDetails').innerHTML=c.map(x=>`<div class=\"check ${x.ok?'':'fail'}\"><div class=\"check-icon\">${x.ok?'✓':'!'}</div><div><strong>${x.title}</strong><small>${x.detail}</small></div></div>`).join('');}\nfunction reset(){selected={bus:'compact',payload:'camera',power:'solar-large',comms:'sband',thermal:'passive'};selectedLauncher='medium';launched=false;$('launchArt').classList.remove('launched');$('launchProgress').style.width='0%';$('launchPct').textContent='0%';$('launchStatus').textContent='T − 00:10 · SYSTEMS STANDBY';$('launchCaption').textContent='Vehicle on launch pad · Awaiting authorization';$('launchBtn').disabled=false;$('launchBtn').textContent='Initiate countdown';$('launchBtn').onclick=runLaunch;save();renderGroups();updateResources();go(0);toast('Mission reset to training configuration')}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-go]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>go(+b.dataset.go)));document.querySelectorAll('.step').forEach(s=>s.addEventListener('click',()=>{let n=+s.dataset.step;if(n===3){if(checks().every(x=>x.ok)){go(3)}else{go(2);toast('Resolve the failed checks before launch')}}else if(n===4&&!launched){toast('Complete the launch sequence first')}else go(n)}));$('heroStart').onclick=()=>go(1);$('toLaunch').onclick=()=>go(3);$('launchBtn').onclick=runLaunch;$('resetBtn').onclick=reset;$('newMission').onclick=reset;\nload();renderGroups();renderLaunchers();updateResources();\n$('cloudSaveBtn').addEventListener('click',cloudSave);\n$('loadNasa').addEventListener('click',async()=>{const out=$('nasaResult'),btn=$('loadNasa');btn.disabled=true;out.textContent='Requesting NASA POWER daily data…';try{const r=await fetch('/api/nasa-power?latitude=13.0827&longitude=80.2707&start=20240101&end=20240107');const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'NASA data request failed');const rows=d.days||[];const avg=rows.length?rows.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.value,0)/rows.length:0;out.textContent=rows.length?`${rows.length} daily values · Average ${avg.toFixed(2)} kWh/m²/day · Jan 1–7, 2024 · Chennai`:'No daily values returned for this date range.';}catch(e){out.textContent='Data unavailable in this preview. Deploy the /api function to enable the NASA data proxy.'}finally{btn.disabled=false}});\nrestoreCloud();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n","missioncraft/demo.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Seven-slide project demonstration for MissionCraft: Launch Lab, a beginner-friendly space mission design game.\"><title>MissionCraft — Project Demo</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#06101e;--panel:#0d1c30;--line:#233c57;--ink:#eff7ff;--muted:#a2b7ce;--cyan:#67e4f1;--blue:#65a0ff;--gold:#ffd27b;--green:#6ce2ac}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 10%,#163c66 0,transparent 38%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 85%,#123448 0,transparent 35%),var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}.deck{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:26px clamp(16px,5vw,70px) 20px;max-width:1500px;margin:auto}.toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px}.brand{font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:12px;color:var(--cyan)}.toolbar a,.control{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#10243a;color:var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;text-decoration:none;font:inherit;font-size:13px}.stage{flex:1;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px 0}.slide{display:none;width:min(1120px,100%);min-height:min(68vh,690px);border:1px solid #294563;border-radius:28px;padding:clamp(25px,5vw,64px);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#10243bed,#091827f2);box-shadow:0 30px 90px #0007;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.slide.active{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;animation:rise .28s ease}.slide:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:300px;height:300px;border:1px solid #6ee8f12b;border-radius:50%;right:-100px;bottom:-160px;box-shadow:0 0 0 35px #6ee8f10a,0 0 0 70px #6ee8f108;pointer-events:none}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:800}.slide h1{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,76px);line-height:1.02;max-width:850px;margin:18px 0}.slide h2{font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.1;margin:14px 0 22px;max-width:880px}.lead{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,22px);color:#c0d2e5;max-width:790px}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.tagline{font-size:12px;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:16px}.tile{background:#0a1929;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:18px;min-height:120px}.tile b{display:block;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#e7f6ff}.tile p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.big-number{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,78px);font-weight:900;color:var(--cyan);line-height:1}.orbital{font-size:86px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 26px #65dff577);text-align:center;margin:0 0 10px}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:9px;margin-top:22px}.flow div{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b1a2a;padding:15px 10px;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.flow span{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font-size:10px;margin-bottom:7px}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:22px}.metric{border:1px solid #315270;border-radius:15px;padding:15px;background:#0c1c2e}.metric strong{display:block;font-size:25px;color:var(--cyan)}.metric small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.source{border-left:3px solid var(--cyan);padding:10px 15px;margin-top:16px;background:#0a1929;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;font-size:13px;color:#bcd1e5}.source a{color:var(--cyan)}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.progress{height:5px;background:#1e344c;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;flex:1}.progress i{height:100%;display:block;width:14.28%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--cyan));transition:width .2s}.controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.count{min-width:55px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13px}.control:disabled{opacity:.35}.dots{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;margin-top:12px}.dot{height:6px;width:17px;border-radius:10px;background:#29435d;border:0;padding:0}.dot.active{background:var(--cyan)}@keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(7px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}@media(max-width:760px){.deck{padding:16px}.slide{min-height:72vh}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.toolbar{align-items:flex-start}.footer{flex-wrap:wrap}.footer .progress{order:3;flex-basis:100%}}\n</style></head><body><div class=\"deck\">\n<header class=\"toolbar\"><div class=\"brand\">MISSIONCRAFT / LAUNCH LAB <span style=\"color:#95a9bd;font-weight:500\">· MAGICBUZZERS</span></div><a href=\"/\">← Back to interactive game</a></header>\n<main class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n<section class=\"slide active\"><div class=\"kicker\">01 / Project introduction</div><div class=\"orbital\">🛰️</div><div class=\"tagline\">Build · Balance · Launch</div><h1>MissionCraft:<br><span style=\"color:var(--cyan)\">Launch Lab</span></h1><p class=\"lead\">A beginner-friendly space mission design game that turns spacecraft engineering trade-offs into interactive learning.</p><p class=\"muted\">NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 · Space Mission Design Game · Erode, India<br>Team MagicBuzzers</p></section>\n<section class=\"slide\"><div class=\"kicker\">02 / The challenge</div><h2>Space mission design is a system of trade-offs.</h2><p class=\"lead\">Students need a way to experiment with mission objectives, payloads, spacecraft systems, launch capacity, power, mass, communications and budget—not just read about them.</p><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\"><b>Too much mass</b><p>The selected launch vehicle cannot carry the spacecraft.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Not enough power</b><p>Subsystem demand can exceed available generation.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Limited resources</b><p>Every engineering choice affects cost and mission readiness.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"slide\"><div class=\"kicker\">03 / Our solution</div><h2>Design a satellite. See the consequences.</h2><p class=\"lead\">Players take the role of a mission director and configure an Earth-observation satellite using a guided, browser-based simulation.</p><div class=\"flow\"><div><span>01</span>Mission brief</div><div><span>02</span>Build systems</div><div><span>03</span>Balance resources</div><div><span>04</span>Readiness gate</div><div><span>05</span>Launch & report</div></div><p class=\"source\">One playable training scenario: Earth Observer-01. All component and launch constraints are clearly labelled illustrative game parameters.</p></section>\n<section class=\"slide\"><div class=\"kicker\">04 / How the game works</div><h2>Five spacecraft systems. One launch decision.</h2><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\"><b>Spacecraft bus</b><p>Core platform and structure.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Scientific payload</b><p>Earth-observation instrument.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Power system</b><p>Solar generation and electrical demand.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Communications</b><p>Data capacity for mission return.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Thermal control</b><p>Basic equipment temperature management.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Launch vehicle</b><p>Payload capacity must fit spacecraft mass.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"slide\"><div class=\"kicker\">05 / Engineering logic</div><h2>Mission readiness is checked before launch.</h2><p class=\"lead\">The game recalculates the design as components change, then blocks launch until every training constraint passes.</p><div class=\"metrics\"><div class=\"metric\"><strong>Budget</strong><small>Credits used vs limit</small></div><div class=\"metric\"><strong>Mass</strong><small>Satellite vs launch capacity</small></div><div class=\"metric\"><strong>Power</strong><small>Generation vs demand</small></div><div class=\"metric\"><strong>Comms</strong><small>Capacity vs mission need</small></div></div><p class=\"source\">The mission score reports the proportion of checks passed. It is a teaching mechanic, not a real-world mission certification score.</p></section>\n<section class=\"slide\"><div class=\"kicker\">06 / NASA data connection</div><h2>Use environmental data to teach solar context.</h2><p class=\"lead\">The prototype includes a server-side connection to NASA POWER daily point data for all-sky surface shortwave downward radiation (ALLSKY_SFC_SW_DWN).</p><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\"><b>Location</b><p>Chennai, India · 13.0827° N, 80.2707° E</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Parameter</b><p>Daily solar radiation, reported by NASA POWER in kWh/m²/day.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Purpose</b><p>Environmental context for solar-energy learning—not live spacecraft telemetry.</p></article></div><div class=\"source\">NASA POWER Daily API documentation: <a href=\"https://power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/services/api/temporal/daily/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/services/api/temporal/daily/</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"slide\"><div class=\"kicker\">07 / Impact, technology & acknowledgement</div><h2>Make mission engineering approachable.</h2><p class=\"lead\">MissionCraft helps beginners understand that spacecraft design is a connected engineering problem: improve one subsystem, and the other constraints may change.</p><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"tile\"><b>Frontend</b><p>HTML, CSS and JavaScript</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Backend & storage</b><p>Vercel Node.js Functions and Supabase Postgres (optional cloud sync); browser local save fallback.</p></article><article class=\"tile\"><b>Future work</b><p>More mission types, richer orbital models and 3D spacecraft visualization.</p></article></div><p class=\"source\"><b>AI-use acknowledgement:</b> Generative AI (ChatGPT by OpenAI) assisted with code scaffolding and drafting project text. The team should review, test and take responsibility for the final implementation. No AI-generated images are used in this slide deck.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:22px\">MagicBuzzers · Raghuvaran Damodaran · Madhumitha D · Praveen RC</p></section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"progress\"><i id=\"progress\"></i></div><div class=\"controls\"><button class=\"control\" id=\"prev\">← Previous</button><span class=\"count\" id=\"count\">1 / 7</span><button class=\"control\" id=\"next\">Next →</button></div></footer><div class=\"dots\" id=\"dots\" aria-label=\"Slide navigation\"></div></div>\n<script>\nconst slides=[...document.querySelectorAll('.slide')];let index=0;const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);function show(n){index=Math.max(0,Math.min(slides.length-1,n));slides.forEach((s,i)=>s.classList.toggle('active',i===index));$('count').textContent=`${index+1} / ${slides.length}`;$('progress').style.width=((index+1)/slides.length*100)+'%';$('prev').disabled=index===0;$('next').disabled=index===slides.length-1;document.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('active',i===index));}slides.forEach((_,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='dot';b.title='Go to slide '+(i+1);b.setAttribute('aria-label','Go to slide '+(i+1));b.onclick=()=>show(i);$('dots').appendChild(b)});$('prev').onclick=()=>show(index-1);$('next').onclick=()=>show(index+1);document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(['ArrowRight',' ','PageDown'].includes(e.key)){e.preventDefault();show(index+1)}if(['ArrowLeft','PageUp'].includes(e.key)){e.preventDefault();show(index-1)}if(e.key==='Home')show(0);if(e.key==='End')show(slides.length-1)});show(0);\n</script></body></html>\n"};
